  <h1>Picture Store</h1>
		<p><i>Marcia's favorite store had just finished celebrating its 20th anniversary last year, but still had plenty of items on sale to draw in customers. Strangely, all the pictures were like those shown here, dangling side-by-side like earrings.</i></p>
		
		<p><i>In fact, every floor and every story of the place was scattered with new pictures all the time. Why were they so frequently distributed?</i></p>

